{"name":"Clean Sweep","hex":"#ccbcb0","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"clean sweep","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A complete or overwhelming victory, especially one in which all or almost all possible electoral contests are won.","The winning, by a person or team, of all the possible possible prizes, games, rounds or contests, etc in a competition, season or series."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/clean_sweep"}],"entries":[{"title":"Clean sweep (naval)","blocks":[{"text":"A \"clean sweep\" for a naval vessel is having \"swept the enemy from the seas\", a completely successful mission. It is traditionally indicated by hanging a broom from a mast or lashing it to the periscope of a submarine."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Sail_of_USS_Wahoo_%28SS-238%29_at_Pearl_Harbor_with_broom%2C_in_February_1943.jpg/330px-Sail_of_USS_Wahoo_%28SS-238%29_at_Pearl_Harbor_with_broom%2C_in_February_1943.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clean_sweep_(naval)"},{"title":"Clean Sweep (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Clean Sweep is a 1918 silent film comedy short. It was produced by the L-KO Kompany and starred actress Merta Sterling. It was distributed through Universal Film Manufacturing Company."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clean_Sweep_(film)"},{"title":"Clean Sweep (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Clean Sweep is an Irish six-part crime thriller television series created by Gary Tieche. Distributed by ZDF Studios, it premiered on RTÉ in Ireland on 14 May 2023 and on SundanceNow in the United States on 22 June 2023. Tieche co-wrote the screenplay with Fran Harris, while it was directed by Ronan Burke and Yves Christian Fournier. Action is largely set in Wicklow with some scenes set in London or Northumbria. Filming began in 2021 in Wicklow, Wicklow Mountains and Dargle River into mid-2022. The main protagonists, Shelly and Jason, are a married couple. Shelly is a stay-at-home mother, who raises their children. Into Shelly's life returns Charlie – a former boyfriend from 20 years ago. Jason is a police detective, who pursues a murderer to advance his career. Jason is assisted by Fiona – the pair are also having a clandestine affair."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clean_Sweep_(TV_series)"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"A Clean Sweep (illustration)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/A_Clean_Sweep_%28illustration%29.jpg/500px-A_Clean_Sweep_%28illustration%29.jpg","ratio":0.7453326950694112,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A_Clean_Sweep_(illustration).jpg","share":0.28625},{"title":"Grey heron (00129p)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/Grey_heron_%2800129p%29.jpg/500px-Grey_heron_%2800129p%29.jpg","ratio":0.8691693290734824,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_heron_(00129p).jpg","share":0.266875},{"title":"A clean sweep - Will Crawford. LCCN2011647366","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/A_clean_sweep_-_Will_Crawford._LCCN2011647366.jpg/500px-A_clean_sweep_-_Will_Crawford._LCCN2011647366.jpg","ratio":0.7550300035298271,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A_clean_sweep_-_Will_Crawford._LCCN2011647366.jpg","share":0.265},{"title":"A Clean Sweep Milwaukee 1910","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/A_Clean_Sweep_Milwaukee_1910.jpg/500px-A_Clean_Sweep_Milwaukee_1910.jpg","ratio":0.6294681778552746,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A_Clean_Sweep_Milwaukee_1910.jpg","share":0.19},{"title":"Grey-breasted mountain toucan (Andigena hypoglauca) Caldas","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Grey-breasted_mountain_toucan_%28Andigena_hypoglauca%29_Caldas.jpg/500px-Grey-breasted_mountain_toucan_%28Andigena_hypoglauca%29_Caldas.jpg","ratio":0.7726960896409787,"lin